From 7b879792770c545c857e94f4ca6f24b1f54127ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:24:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] brush-js: PLY export and eval renders for a hosting
 worker

Training.exportPly(comments) returns the current splats as PLY bytes with
extra header comments; Training.renderEval() renders the dataset's eval views
as the eval does and returns channel 0 as Float32Arrays, so a worker can score
held-out views and hand the result to the page.
---
 Cargo.lock               |  3 ++
 apps/brush-js/Cargo.toml |  3 ++
 apps/brush-js/src/lib.rs | 79 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 85 insertions(+)

